<title>USA: CME average feeder steer price.</title>
<headline>CME average feeder steer price.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Mercantile Exchange reported the average feeder steer price for the seven calendar days ending Friday, May 9 used for cash settlement of CME Feeder Cattle contracts. (in dollars per cwt) --</p>
<p>12-STATES - FOR 7 DAYS ENDING -</p>
<p>Friday	   May 9  $75.29    up 1.93</p>
<p>Thursday	 May 8  $73.36    up 0.28</p>
